 "summary": "A bare quartz resonator, AT cut on its fundamental, in the surface-mount HC-49SMD package, 11.4 mm long, 4.8 mm wide and 3.8 mm tall. It comes at nominal frequencies from 3.2768 MHz to 32 MHz with two pads, one at each end, across which the resonator sits. Standard load capacitances are 12 pF and 20 pF and standard tolerances at 25 °C ±10 ppm and ±20 ppm, others to order. Industrial control is the named use.",
